<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>The entire crowd rose and intoned:\

\f2\i <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Momma, I swear,\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>I shall never bite off more than I can chew\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>After midnight\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>I shall never binge on bacon fat and coffee grounds\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>After midnight\
